sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant RAG as RAG Service<br/>FoodReviewRagService
    participant BE as Backend API<br/>Express
    participant Mongo as MongoDB<br/>food_reviews
    participant Chunk as Chunking<br/>build_documents()
    participant Embed as Embedding<br/>SentenceTransformer
    participant Chroma as ChromaDB<br/>food_reviews

    RAG->>RAG: _ensure_index()

    alt Chưa có collection hoặc cần rebuild
        RAG->>BE: GET /api/client/food-reviews<br/>page, limit=50, sortBy=hot
        BE->>Mongo: Query food_reviews<br/>kèm phân trang và sắp xếp
        Mongo-->>BE: Danh sách reviews
        BE-->>RAG: JSON {data, pagination}

        loop Với từng review
            RAG->>Chunk: build_documents(review)
            Chunk-->>RAG: title_summary chunk<br/>và content chunks
        end

        loop Theo batch chunks
            RAG->>Embed: encode passages<br/>normalize_embeddings=true
            Embed-->>RAG: embeddings
            RAG->>Chroma: add(ids, documents,<br/>metadatas, embeddings)
            Chroma-->>RAG: ack
        end

        RAG->>RAG: Ghi food_reviews.meta.json<br/>built_at, model, chunk config
    else Chỉ mục còn hợp lệ
        RAG->>RAG: Dùng lại ChromaDB hiện có
    end
